# LF in the repository and in every checkout, regardless of the contributor's
# core.autocrlf. Line endings are not a matter of local taste here: the CSVs
# under data/ are parsed, hashed and cited, and a checkout that silently
# rewrites them would change their bytes without changing their content.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
